### 2. Bug Code Snippets Analysis

- **`lighthouse-core/gather/driver.js`**: This is where the user agent is fetched (`getUserAgent()`) and where emulation is enabled (`beginEmulation`). The emulated user agent is set in the emulation logic, but not exposed.
- **`lighthouse-core/gather/gather-runner.js`**: This is where the base artifacts are collected, including the user agent (`UserAgent: await options.driver.getUserAgent()`). It does not currently collect the emulated user agent.
- **`lighthouse-core/report/html/renderer/report-renderer.js`**: This is where the report footer is rendered, and the user agent is displayed. It only shows `report.userAgent`.

